## Where things live

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `.docs/architecture.md` | How the project is built — the assistant reads it before working |
| `.docs/todo.md` / `todo_done.md` | Open and finished work |
| `.docs/tasks/` | One folder per feature TASK: `spec.md`, `plan.md` and their HTML views |
| `.docs/tasks/done/` | Finished TASK folders |
| `.docs/templates/` | Formats for specs, plans, and HTML views — edit only to change the format |
| {{IF_CLAUDE}}`.claude/rules/rules.md`{{/IF_CLAUDE}}{{IF_COPILOT}}`.github/instructions/rules.instructions.md`{{/IF_COPILOT}} | The rules the assistant follows — add your own conventions here |

Add any other notes to `.docs/` (API docs, decisions, runbooks) — the assistant reads them when a task needs them.

## Tips

- Testing: {{TEST_INSTRUCTIONS}}
- Ask *"what's on the todo list?"* to pick up where you left off.
- Ask *"how do I …?"* about this setup — the assistant can read this manual too.
